        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Moe Greene, Moe Dalitz\n- Works: The Godfather novel, The Godfather film\n- Topics: Fictional characters, American gangsters\n\nFacts:\n- Moe Dalitz, born Morris Barney Dalitz, was born on December 25, 1899 and died on August 31, 1989.\n- Moe Dalitz was an American gangster, businessman, casino owner, and philanthropist.\n- Mario Puzo's 1969 novel The Godfather includes the fictional character Morris \"Moe\" Greene.\n- The 1972 film The Godfather also features the fictional character Morris \"Moe\" Greene.",
